«
@@ ============================================================
@@ WPLegs — the legs of the route, with their distance and course.
@@
@@ Output: a list with one { "A→B" distance course } list per leg,
@@         then the total distance of the route. Distances are in
@@         nautical miles, along the WGS-84 ellipsoid (VincentyInv);
@@         the course is the initial true course of the leg.
@@ ============================================================

  'Route' RCL
  → rtl
  «
    { } 0_nmi
    1 rtl SIZE 1 - FOR ii
      rtl ii GET LIST→ DROP
      rtl ii 1 + GET LIST→ DROP
      → na pa la nb pb lb
      «
        pa la pb lb ⓁVincentyInv DROP
        → dst crs
        «
          dst 1_nmi CONVERT
          → dnm
          «
            na "→" + nb + dnm crs 3 →LIST 1 →LIST
            ROT SWAP + SWAP dnm +
          »
        »
      »
    NEXT
    "Total" →TAG
  »
»
